Solve bottom-up per chain: for the bottom cell c_k: click(c_k) = need(c_k) where need = (current != target).
Then for c_i (i<k): click(c_i) XOR click(c_{i+1}) = need(c_i) → click(c_i) = need(c_i) XOR click(c_{i+1}).
